ement and receiving import, with source-record previews, selected-record submission, returned import results and source fields, and imported-record viewing without enabled import actions for users lacking operational access.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 3,\n  \"text\": \"Add mapping from PO lines to multiple lots and lots to multiple pens, retaining and displaying allocated animal quantities, returned pen details, and saved mappings, while restricting mapping changes to operationally authorized users.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 4,\n  \"text\": \"On repeat imports, display records the service matches to existing source identifiers without presenting them as newly created duplicates.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 5,\n  \"text\": \"Display market-date and target-weight forecasts from incoming animal data and yard defaults, applying lot overrides, showing projected dates as unavailable without a positive gain rate, and restricting forecast-assumption editing to authorized managers.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 6,\n  \"text\": \"Display feed inventory items and stock movements, and let authorized inventory users maintain items, record receipts or adjustments, and change wastage settings; users with viewing access can see inventory values without enabled edit actions.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 7,\n  \"text\": \"Display inventory projections for daily, weekly, monthly, quarterly, semi-annual, and annual horizons based on saved upcoming feed plans and configured wastage, show empty-data states when plans are absent, and list known actual wastage separately from delivered-feed consumption.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 8,\n  \"text\": \"Let authorized ration managers create, revise, optimize, and approve ration definitions; display ingredients, proportions, nutrition, and cost; and present the lowest-cost candidate meeting selected requirements with a separate save action.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 9,\n  \"text\": \"Let authorized planners generate or adjust dated pen-level feed plans from selected dates, pens, bunk rates, rations, and animal counts, and display returned plan details and execution status; users without planning access can view existing plans without plan actions.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 10,\n  \"text\": \"Flag saved plans for review when relevant inputs change, retain saved values until an authorized planner confirms an update or regenerates a plan, allow assigned-pen operators to update execution status, and show intake variance without automatically changing saved plans.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 11,\n  \"text\": \"Let operational users record feeding activity by pen and lot, and display returned event details, variance, cost, energy, inventory consumption, feeding status, and lot-level consumption and cost totals; show returned stock errors without saving refused events.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 12,\n  \"text\": \"Let authorized livestock or operations users add lot weight measurements, and display saved measurements and time-ordered history with returned gain information; users without entry access can view history without an enabled add action.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 13,\n  \"text\": \"Display returned lot feed-to-gain metrics, including days on feed, weight gain, average daily gain, feed consumed, feed conversion ratio, cost of gain, and projected ship date; show the date as unavailable without positive ADG and refresh metrics after feeding or weight records change.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 14,\n  \"text\": \"Present explainable rule-based feeding-adjustment or sale-timing suggestions based on lot weight-gain trends, leaving plan or sale changes unchanged until the user explicitly acts.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 15,\n  \"text\": \"Display yard and lot performance, inventory, feeding, weight, cost, and energy dashboard values, and let users choose the measure used to rank best- and worst-performing lots.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 16,\n  \"text\": \"Provide filterable operational reports for inventory, feeding, lot performance, and profitability that answer the specified pen, lot, ration, plan-variance, inventory, and cost-of-gain questions, and export filtered results as CSV.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 17,\n  \"text\": \"Limit dashboards, reports, and exports to yards, records, and profitability fields allowed by the signed-in user’s returned permissions.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 18,\n  \"text\": \"Provide a feed-to-gain report comparing lot ADG, FCR, and cost of gain, with date-range, breed, sex, and pen filters and permission-limited CSV or PDF exports; indicate unavailable sex data where applicable.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 19,\n  \"text\": \"Provide an authorized-yard lot profitability list with filters and CSV export of filtered authorized results, and hide profitability values when the service says the user cannot view them.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 20,\n  \"text\": \"Let authorized users load visibly designated sample data, prevent duplicate sample loading while displaying the returned result, and require confirmation before reset or replacement.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 21,\n  \"text\": \"Display returned yard-level active-lot total head, average ADG, average cost of gain, and total feed cost, with unavailable values where required source data is missing.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 22,\n  \"text\": \"Provide a delivery overview or presentation page with the proposed solution, architecture diagrams, app demo entry point, prompts used, testing and validation overview, challenges, production-readiness assessment, and go-to-market analysis.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 23,\n  \"text\": \"Make every page responsive at phone, tablet, and desktop widths without horizontal page overflow, and provide primary touch controls at least 44 by 44 CSS pixels on narrow screens.\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\nMap the sentences."}